# Commits to ignore in `git blame` — mass formatting and mechanical moves only.
#
# Append the full 40-char SHA of any commit that is purely:
#   - a repo-wide format pass (prettier / swift-format)
#   - a mechanical file move or rename (package extraction, folder restructure)
# Never add commits that mix formatting/moves with logic changes.
#
# Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# (GitHub's blame view picks this file up automatically by name.)
